      "verified": "2026-08-26 GH: checked against the values computed in Expected - volume 965.96590308 against 965.9658863893 (1.7e-8) and area 563.856826194 against 563.8561794180 (1.1e-6), both closed forms. holeLoops 21 is one loop per pip and euler 2 says none of them pierces the body; closed, consistent, extent exactly the 10 mm cube. The face count and the surface histogram are captured, not derived: the spherical faces come out split at their seams, 65 instead of the minimal 29, which is also why edgeLength is 387.28 rather than the 322.9996535444 of the unsplit model - 36 extra seam arcs."
